  "$comment": "Portfolio palette. ONE pack, several brands, because Wise, Healf, Ticketmaster and Asos were given the same ramps and three byte-identical files is precisely the drift every check in design/ exists to stop. Split it the day they diverge: copy the file and narrow each `brands` list. Values are Rohit's 'Portfolio Build' Figma collections verbatim, teal 10 + navy 10 + neutral 11 = 31 primitives. It EXTENDS the base collection and replaces nothing: the primitives are additive and the semantic layer re-points the same 38 names every component already binds to, so no component, band or stylesheet changes.",
